'''Super Sloth''' is a [[mini-boss]] and one of the [[Seven Deadly Sins#Super Sins|Seven Super Deadly Sins]]. He is randomly encountered as an alternate version of {{E|Sloth}}.

== Behavior ==
Super Sloth wanders randomly around the room and performs one of two attacks:
* Fires 2 {{i|Ipecac}} projectiles in Isaac's direction.
* Spits out 2 {{E|Spider}}s or {{dlc|r}} a {{E|Big Spider}} in Isaac's direction.
* Super Sloth deals a whole heart of contact damage.

== Notes ==
* In a mini-boss room, Super Sloth can spawn with 2-4 {{E|Charger}}s or 2 {{E|Attack Fly|text=Attack Flies}}.
* {{dlc|nr}} Super Sloth can drop {{i|Bob's Curse}} even if Isaac has already encountered/possessed it. 

== Trivia ==
* Super Sloth appears to be a recolored {{E|Gazing Globin}} with a large head. This may be done humorously to represent his sin, sloth (laziness).
* The [[wikipedia:Seven Deadly Sins|Seven Deadly Sins]] that these mini-bosses are based upon are, in Christian teachings, a classification of vices from which all others are derived.

